Package: DGEData
Type: Package
Title: Data Types to store DGE Results Data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Huzefa Khalil
Maintainer: Huzefa Khalil <huzefa.khalil@umich.edu>
Description: This package defines the S4 classes which encapsulate the DGE data. At the lowest level is the DGEComparison which comprises of one comparison in an experiment. The comparison is the output of a differential expression analysis using limma or edgeR. An experiment is comprised of one or many comparisons. Finally, we also provide a data structure which comprises of a list of experiments.
